{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33661","headline":"送从弟长安下第南归觐亲 · 邵谒","name":"送从弟长安下第南归觐亲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日不得照，戴天如戴盆。\n青云未见路，丹车劳出门。\n采薇秦山镇，养亲湘水源。\n心中岂不切，其如行路难。\n爲文清益峻，爲心直且安。\n芝兰未入用，馨香志独存。\n他门种桃李，犹能荫子孙。\n我家有棠阴，枝叶竟不繁。\n心醉岂因酒，愁多徒见萱。\n征徒忽告归，执袂殷勤论。\n在鸟终爲凤，爲鱼须化鲲。\n富贵岂长守，贫贱宁有根。\n丈夫志不大，何以佐乾坤。\n昼短疾於箭，早来献天言。\n莫恋苍梧畔，野烟横破村。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33661.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33661","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}